{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4001_p", "source_sha256": "b6768ec25d5b1becbb074ea424a0a7bb5a7dfae572d941428f52fc824203858a", "ja": "麗花、稽古お疲れさま。\nこの調子で、明日の本番も頼むぞ。", "zh": "丽花，排练辛苦了。\n就照着这个步调，明天的正式演出也拜托你啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4002_048rei", "source_sha256": "2f15cc45f5679e20acfc3fd53290c53c11fadd08bade90a937d02e9a5d4e9b86", "ja": "あれあれ～、もう終わりですか？\nうーん……居残り練習しちゃダメですか？", "zh": "咦咦～已经结束了吗？\n唔～嗯……不能留下来练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4003_p", "source_sha256": "e730cadfae81c93de5b665d9ed43eebe2b11927d862848462474ff638040422f", "ja": "居残り練習か……。", "zh": "留下来练习吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4004", "source_sha256": "0cdefcd1cda29a91aa113b49930bfc7d8b20fd38fefe703aaa1dcdee22936f5c", "ja": "とことんやろう", "zh": "尽量练吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4005", "source_sha256": "956bf98350a10efbea9071ba4d085dc0c040ad7a5e03d1e927a0dc00ff479bae", "ja": "明日に備えよう", "zh": "为明天做准备", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4006", "source_sha256": "b4bf2355029202bd2952b2f53b3ddc9bc72602b9089cc3edb273625cf62411c3", "ja": "気をつけて帰れ", "zh": "注意安全回家吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4100_p", "source_sha256": "11de6d71f8ff659dbcf688bca1dd17a307f7927002499f1aac8e83513120d64a", "ja": "悔いは残してほしくないからな。\nよし、とことんやるか！", "zh": "我也不希望你留下遗憾呀。\n好，你就尽量练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4101_048rei", "source_sha256": "e0020dac6b38238ee859e1a35e066ebb00a59d2c977a4e80886d79968b78ff85", "ja": "わーい！\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "耶──！\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4102_048rei", "source_sha256": "7a08259f853678843eff1c27a9398a43858b1a0ddfff02ee63d7de5f836cd659", "ja": "素敵な役をくれた{$P$}さんの\nためにも、私、明日は全力で頑張りますね♪", "zh": "这也是为了给我超棒角色的{$P$}\n先生，我明天会用尽全力加油的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4103_048rei", "source_sha256": "89ae55fde07977c58d3617317676d57775ac286d9d8cfd67ae8381cdf20de292", "ja": "最高の演技ができるように、\n手取り足取り音頭取り、よろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "为了掌握顶尖的演技，\n麻烦你细心贴心好开心地指导我啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4200_p", "source_sha256": "162a9c33ed310573383322156f822b064f065c52502225848933e6d921162283", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど、時間も時間だ。\n明日に備えて、ここで切り上げよう。", "zh": "我可以理解你的心情，但也得注意时间。\n为了明天的表演，今天就到此为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4201_048rei", "source_sha256": "4dd0e634e694a99351de0fdf718f5cb8514d682b07c731377831ae80416f049b", "ja": "はーい、わかりました。\nじゃあ気になる部分は、家で練習しますね。", "zh": "好～我知道了。\n那还不够好的部分，我就在家练习啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4202_048rei", "source_sha256": "d53cbcb71ac72b65342729852d3dc7fe2a4ffe8451b99f79cc57fde19e818988", "ja": "本番、楽しみだな～。ふふ♪\n明日も一緒に頑張りましょうね♪", "zh": "好期待正式演出呀～呵呵♪\n明天也要一起加油喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4300_p", "source_sha256": "e22b977aee74525da379e2c2fcb46a7b7a146a1a32eef5f9f3b5e1118242a1ed", "ja": "いや、無理をして明日に影響するとよくないからな。\n気をつけて帰ってくれ。", "zh": "不，要是把自己累坏，反而影响到明天可不好，\n注意安全回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4301_048rei", "source_sha256": "1f3c8908f73f0ec5a22042cedb8e95c91719a73110fe8b6442e573b2e9693beb", "ja": "うーん、そうですか……残念！　でもでも、\nわかりました！　じゃあ寂しくなったら電話しますね♪", "zh": "唔～这样啊……真可惜！但是但是，\n我知道了！那我觉得寂寞的话就打给你喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_4302_048rei", "source_sha256": "f19f8c0e9a3abf23889a29ef566f5fd90353fcf2c9cd6f7bc799c90fcf62bd0f", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、私が恋しくなったら\n連絡ください♪　ではでは、お疲れさまでした♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生你也是，要是想我了\n就请联络我吧♪那么那么，辛苦啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
